SUMMARY:SIKA Deer - A/ML/F
DESCRIPTION:Archery: antlered and antlerless legal. Legal for Junior hunt
 ers (and\, if the regular Archery season is open that day\, all licensed 
 archery hunters) Muzzleloader: antlered and antlerless legal. Legal for J
 unior hunters only on Junior Deer Hunt Day Firearms: antlered and antlerl
 ess legal. Legal for Junior hunters only on Junior Deer Hunt Day Junior D
 eer Hunt Day: hunters age 16 or younger only\, must be accompanied by an 
 unarmed adult 21+ who holds a valid MD hunting license (Apprentice licens
 e does not qualify). Separate bag limit\; harvest does not count against 
 regular season bag limits. Junior hunters are exempt from antler point re
 strictions. Shooting hours: 1/2 hour before sunrise to 1/2 hour after sun
 set.
